00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:26.060
Right now, at the time this video goes up,
there are already three Conjuring films being

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.060
developed.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.390
First, we’ve got a third Annabelle movie,
which will be a sequel to The Conjuring films,

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:34.090
where Annabelle is locked up in the room of
cursed objects in the Warren home and starts

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.910
to interact with the other objects to create
mayhem.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.800
However, the line that separates the mainline
Conjuring films from the spin-offs so far

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.050
is that The Conjuring films feature Ed and
Lorraine Warren, while the spin-offs do not.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:49.510
But with this movie taking place in the Warren
home, wouldn’t that make it a mainline Conjuring

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:50.510
film?

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:51.510
Here’s how I think it will go down.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:55.080
In the first film, The Conjuring, we see Ed
and Lorraine’s daughter Judy, sneak into

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.280
the room and she is reprimanded for it.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.530
Then later on in the movie she wakes up in
the middle of the night to find the door,

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:04.940
which has like 100 locks on it by the way,
ajar with the Annabelle doll missing from

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.280
it’s case.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.260
"Dad?"

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:23.950
And then a creepy lady is combing Annabelle’s
hair in the rocking chair, and then this happens.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:28.460
...but when Ed checks things out, everything
is in order.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:32.210
We don’t really know what happens to Annabelle
after that because the first two Annabelle

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:36.210
movies are prequels that take place before
The Conjuring and we only really spot Annabelle

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:38.900
in the case at the end of The Conjuring 2.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.159
So my guess is that Annabelle 3 will take
place while The Warrens are away on another

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:45.890
case, perhaps this takes place at the same
time as The Conjuring 3, and the film will

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:50.090
focus on Judy or the Nanny who takes care
of her as horrors start to take place around

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.090
the house.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.460
With Ed and Lorraine not there to help, Judy
may have to take on this entity on her own.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.110
She’s also a teenager now, so that comes
with its own set of problems, and maybe to

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:02.799
defeat the spirit possessing the Annabelle
doll, Judy has to have her own spiritual awakening

00:02:02.799 --> 00:02:04.080
as a medium.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.080
After Annabelle 3, the next movie in the franchise
is The Crooked Man.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:11.310
We don’t know anything about this one yet,
but like the other initial spin-offs, Annabelle

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:15.219
and The Nun, The Crooked Man will most likely
be an origin story for the entity that spooks

00:02:15.219 --> 00:02:17.319
on the Hodgson family in The Conjuring 2.

00:02:17.319 --> 00:02:20.909
However, it’s not entirely clear if The
Crooked Man is just another form of Valak,

00:02:20.909 --> 00:02:23.659
or if he’s his own entity that Valak takes
control of.

00:02:23.659 --> 00:02:27.640
At the end of The Conjuring 2, it is The Crooked
Man children’s toy that Ed puts into the

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.569
room of cursed objects, which kind of suggests
that it was Valak, but now that The Crooked

00:02:31.569 --> 00:02:34.599
Man is getting his own movie, we’ll have
to see if that holds true.

00:02:34.599 --> 00:02:38.389
The last film that is currently being produced
is The Conjuring 3, which will obviously be

00:02:38.389 --> 00:02:40.129
based off of one of The Warrens’ published
cases.

00:02:40.129 --> 00:02:44.620
But we’re not here to talk about The Conjuring
3, we’re here to talk about future spin-offs.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:45.790
What might be in store?

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:50.299
Well in 2016 there was a short film competition
known as The My Annabelle Creation Contest,

00:02:50.299 --> 00:02:53.359
where filmmakers were challenged to make their
own Conjuring Universe film.

00:02:53.359 --> 00:02:57.360
The winner was an entry by a filmmaker named
Julian Terry, about a girl in the hospital

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:01.180
after undergoing some eye procedure and the
demonic nurse that haunts her.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:05.230
No, I’m not gonna show the whole thing because
I don’t want anyone getting sued.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.230
Mostly me.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.870
I don’t want myself getting sued, but it
seems to be a likely conclusion that The Nurse

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.680
will be joining the lineup of bad guys in
The Conjuring universe sometime in the early

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.099
2020s.

00:03:15.099 --> 00:03:18.950
Later in the real-life Warrens’ careers,
they took on a couple of disciples, Dave Considine

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:25.230
and John Zaffis, who went on to have careers
as media personalities… excuse me, Demonologists,

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.230
of their own.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:28.090
Zaffis is actually the nephew of The Warren
couple.

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:31.930
He has his own museum of paranormal objects
and you can read about some of them on his

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:32.930
website.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:36.849
Personally, I could see Simon, a supposedly
haunted puppet, being the subject of a future

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:40.779
Conjuring film, given James Wan’s affinity
for creepy puppets, so much so that his Twitter

00:03:40.779 --> 00:03:42.109
handle is @creepypuppet.

00:03:42.109 --> 00:03:45.930
The family who owned Simon claims their young
son would tell them that the puppet talked

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.329
to him, and one day the mother walked into
his room to see the puppet’s mouth moving

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:50.669
on it’s own.

00:03:50.669 --> 00:03:54.279
Other notable objects that I could see getting
their own movies include a clown antique that

00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:58.180
causes extreme discomfort for those who touch
it; Marionettes that have been blamed for

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:02.909
causing bizarre dreams; Mr. Sinister, an ornament
that has been said to cause unexplainable

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:08.199
odors and quote ‘a very bad tingling feeling’;
an Idol said to be cursed with black magic;

00:04:08.199 --> 00:04:13.109
Mr. Bojo, a poppet accused of causing supernatural
occurences in a house and nightmares involving

00:04:13.109 --> 00:04:18.459
a life-sized version of Mr. Bojo; and Island
Man, a three foot statue said to move around

00:04:18.459 --> 00:04:23.060
the owners house on it’s own, talk to their
son, and supposedly move the son from room

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.060
to room.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:27.400
So that leaves us with a ton of ideas for
possible movies in The Conjuring Universe.

